# Uploaded to Vercel for the frontend build (root directory: Production-Core/frontend). Never: secrets,
# the Python environment, dependencies or build output. The story assets (placeholder-assets) ARE uploaded: the site
# ships them (VITE_PLACEHOLDERS=ship), while they stay out of git.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
Production-Core/venv
Production-Core/docs
Production-Core/infrastructure
